1.0.0
  Summary: First release, hit sharing, NPC self-healing fix, per-rank accuracy, sniper and launcher crouch
  First release. NPC combat AI organised around a shared per-squad memory substrate.
  Four user-facing systems on top of one internal core. Full MCM configuration.
  Added: Hit Sharing - on first faction-enemy hit, force-disclose shooter to every online squadmate (force_set_goodwill, enable_memory_object, register_in_combat). Distant patrols and suppressor victims now engage on hit 1.
  Added: Squad Memory - shared per-squad DTO keyed by squad_id, lazy-init on first hit, decay tick prunes per-shooter entries on TTL.
  Added: NPC Self-Healing - DLTX overlay restores vanilla medkit and bandage item lists in xr_eat_medkit. Heal rate multiplier, per-rank healing-charge probability (novice, experienced, veteran, master), limping overlay, heal animation.
  Added: Accuracy - per-shot, per-rank NPC dispersion curve replacing the engine's broken rank curve. 8 per-tier multiplier sliders (novice 1.00 to legend 0.38).
  Added: Stance Switch - sniper and launcher carriers crouch when engine selects LookOut or HoldPosition, crouch carries forward into KillEnemy, WaitInCover, HoldAmbushLocation through body_state inheritance.
  Added: MCM reset-to-defaults button (Development tab).
  Added: console test commands at_spawn, at_spawn_veteran, at_spawn_master, at_spawn_far, at_dump.
